WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.420
What happens to three hundred US dollars when
they are put through the Clockworks?

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.410
The first hundred dollars was put through
on the setting Coarse.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.760
It produced a puddle of ink, and a pile of
cotton and plastic.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.580
All in all, the materials weighed about the
same amount as the original stack of cash.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.640
The second hundred dollars was placed in the
machinery, set to 1:1.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.840
It produced seventy-five euros in cash.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.540
The third hundred dollars, run through the
machine on the setting Fine, produced a shareholder’s

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.449
note for “Soap from Corpses Products”
in the amount of one hundred dollars.

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:34.250
Long story short, it probably isn’t a good
idea to try to use SCP-914 to increase the

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.719
value of one’s money.

